OL,3,GNEWSAStaff at viral Welsh cake business
OL,4,Avisited by Hollywood star suffer racist
OL,5,Aabuse                                  
OL,7,FThe owner of a viral bakery has called 
OL,8,Fout the racist abuse his staff have    
OL,9,Fbeen subjected to online.              
OL,11,FAdam El Tagoury, 46, owns Cardiff      
OL,12,FBakestones in Cardiff Market, which has
OL,13,Fattracted visitors including actor     
OL,14,FStanley Tucci, and regularly shares    
OL,15,Fvideos of his busy staff on social     
OL,16,Fmedia.                                 
OL,18,FIn a viral TikTok video, he named and  
OL,19,Fshamed people who made "vile" remarks  
OL,20,Fquestioning whether his staff with     
OL,21,FAsian heritage should be making        
OL,22,Ftraditional Welsh products.            
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
